<title>USA: Fedders to increase China plant capacity.</title>
<headline>Fedders to increase China plant capacity.</headline>
<dateline>LIBERTY CORNER, N.J. 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fedders Corp said it expects to increase production capacity by the end of the year at its plant in Ningbo, China.</p>
<p>The air conditioner manufacturer said that the board of directors of Fedders Xinle Co Ltd authorized an increase in production capacity to 500,000 units annually from the present 200,000 units.</p>
<p>Fedders has a 60 percent interest in the joint venture factory, which manufactures air conditioners for sale in China and other global markets.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
